    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A pre-Fall mixtape someone made for someone they loved, labeled only FOR THE LONG DRIVE in faded marker. Plays on anything with the decency to have a tape deck. Mal is fond of it and will occasionally sing along, badly, on purpose.</p><p><strong>Use.</strong> During a rest, play it to clear 1d6 Stress from each ally who listens. Once per session — the magic is in the first listen.</p>",
